<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard price upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard price upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckingham Research analyst Jay Stevens said he raised his upside price target on Hewlett-Packard Co to $80 from $70 and continues to rate the stock a buy.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Hewlett-Packard were up 1/8 to 68-3/8.</p>
